              "text": "To solve this problem, we need to simulate the growth and death of numoebae based on the given rules. Let's break down the steps and write the Python script accordingly.\n\n1. **Read the input**: We will read the initial numbosome values of the numoeba cells.\n2. **Simulate the numoeba's life**: For each initial numbosome value, we will simulate the numoeba's life cycle, updating the numbosome values, identifying candidate leaves, and determining the fate of the cells.\n3. **Output the results**: For each initial numbosome value, we will output the numoeba's lifetime and the maximum number of constituent cells during its life.\n\nHere's the Python script to achieve this:\n\n```python\ndef get_max_odd_factor(n):\n    while n % 2 == 0:\n        n //= 2\n    return n\n\ndef update_numbosome_value(numbosome_value):\n    new_value = 3 * numbosome_value + 1\n    new_value = get_max_odd_factor(new_value)\n    if new_value > 12345678:\n        new_value -= 12345678\n    return new_value\n\ndef is_leaf(numoeba, cell):\n    return len(numoeba[cell]) == 1 and cell != numoeba['root']\n\ndef is_dying(numoeba, cell):\n    return numoeba[cell]['numbosome'] == 1\n\ndef get_candidate_leaves(numoeba):\n    candidate_leaves = []\n    for cell in numoeba:\n        if is_leaf(numoeba, cell) and update_numbosome_value(numoeba[cell]['numbosome']) > numoeba[cell]['numbosome']:\n            candidate_leaves.append(cell)\n    return candidate_leaves\n\ndef get_max_numbosome_value(numoeba):\n    return max(numoeba[cell]['numbosome'] for cell in numoeba)\n\ndef get_new_leader(numoeba):\n    max_value = get_max_numbosome_value(numoeba)\n    for cell in numoeba:\n        if numoeba[cell]['numbosome'] == max_value:\n            return cell\n    return numoeba['root']\n\ndef update_numoeba(numoeba, cell):\n    if is_dying(numoeba, cell):\n        if cell == numoeba['root']:\n            return False\n        parent = numoeba[cell]['parent']\n        if len(numoeba[parent]['children']) == 1:\n            numoeba[parent]['children'][0] = cell\n        else:\n            numoeba[parent]['children'].remove(cell)\n            for child in numoeba[cell]['children']:\n                numoeba[child]['parent'] = parent\n                numoeba[parent]['children'].append(child)\n            numoeba[parent]['children'].remove(cell)\n    else:\n        numoeba[cell]['numbosome'] = update_numbosome_value(numoeba[cell]['numbosome'])\n    return True\n\ndef simulate_numoeba(initial_numbosome_value):\n    numoeba = {\n        'root': {\n            'numbosome': initial_numbosome_value,\n            'parent': None,\n            'children': []\n        }\n    }\n    numoeba['root']['children'].append('root')\n    numoeba['root']['parent'] = 'root'\n    max_cells = 1\n    lifetime = 0\n\n    while True:\n        candidate_leaves = get_candidate_leaves(numoeba)\n        for cell in candidate_leaves:\n            parent = numoeba[cell]['parent']\n            new_leaf_numbosome_value = (numoeba[cell]['numbosome'] + 1) // 2\n            new_leaf_numbosome_value = (new_leaf_numbosome_value + 1) // 2 * 2 + 1\n            numoeba[parent]['children'].append(f'new_leaf_{len(numoeba)}')\n            numoeba[f'new_leaf_{len(numoeba)}'] = {\n                'numbosome': new_leaf_numbosome_value,\n                'parent': parent,\n                'children': []\n            }\n            numoeba[parent]['children'].remove(cell)\n            numoeba[parent]['children'].append(f'new_leaf_{len(numoeba)}')\n            numoeba[f'new_leaf_{len(numoeba)}']['parent'] = parent\n            numoeba[f'new_leaf_{len(numoeba)}']['children'] = []\n            max_cells = max(max_cells, len(numoeba))\n\n        new_leader = get_new_leader(numoeba)\n        numoeba[new_leader]['children'].append(f'new_leader_{len(numoeba)}')\n        numoeba[f'new_leader_{len(numoeba)}'] = {\n            'numbosome': (numoeba[new_leader]['numbosome'] + 1) // 2,\n            'parent': new_leader,\n            'children': []\n        }\n        numoeba[f'new_leader_{len(numoeba)}']['parent'] = new_leader\n        numoeba[f'new_leader_{len(numoeba)}']['children'] = []\n\n        for cell in numoeba:\n            update_numoeba(numoeba, cell)\n\n        if not update_numoeba(numoeba, numoeba['root']):\n            break\n\n        lifetime += 1\n\n    return lifetime, max_cells\n\ndef main():\n    while True:\n        initial_numbosome_value = int(input())\n        if initial_numbosome_value == 0:\n            break\n        lifetime, max_cells = simulate_numoeba(initial_numbosome_value)\n        print(f\"{lifetime} {max_cells}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\nThis script reads the initial numbosome values, simulates the numoeba's life, and outputs the lifetime and maximum number of cells for each initial numbosome value.",
