              "text": "To solve this problem, we need to determine the number of times the character will be damaged when moving to each of the N destinations. The character is damaged only when moving to a poisonous swamp, which is any square not within the specified rectangle of non-poisonous land.\n\nHere's the Python script to solve the problem:\n\n```python\nwhile True:\n    # Read the number of destinations N\n    N = int(input())\n    if N == 0:\n        break\n\n    # Read the coordinates of the rectangle of non-poisonous land\n    A, B, C, D = map(int, input().split())\n\n    # Read the initial position of the character\n    X0, Y0 = map(int, input().split())\n\n    # Read the coordinates of the N destinations\n    destinations = [tuple(map(int, input().split())) for _ in range(N)]\n\n    # Function to check if a cell is a non-poisonous land\n    def is_non_poisonous_land(x, y):\n        return A <= x <= C and B <= y <= D\n\n    # Function to calculate the Manhattan distance between two cells\n    def manhattan_distance(x1, y1, x2, y2):\n        return abs(x1 - x2) + abs(y1 - y2)\n\n    # Initialize the total damage count\n    total_damage = 0\n\n    # Calculate the damage for each move\n    for i in range(N):\n        # Calculate the distance to the next destination\n        x1, y1 = X0, Y0\n        x2, y2 = destinations[i]\n        if is_non_poisonous_land(x1, y1):\n            if is_non_poisonous_land(x2, y2):\n                total_damage += 0\n            else:\n                total_damage += 1\n        else:\n            if is_non_poisonous_land(x2, y2):\n                total_damage += 1\n            else:\n                total_damage += 0\n\n        # Move to the next destination\n        X0, Y0 = x2, y2\n\n    print(total_damage)\n```\n\nThis script reads the input, processes each dataset, and calculates the number of times the character is damaged. It uses the Manhattan distance to determine the shortest path between the current position and the destination, and checks if the cells are within the non-poisonous land rectangle.",
