              "text": "Certainly! Let's break down the problem and write a Python script to solve it. We need to process the input and construct the tree-like structure as specified.\n\nHere is the step-by-step plan:\n1. Read the number of posts `n`.\n2. For each post, read the depth `k_i` and the message `M_i`.\n3. Construct the tree structure based on the depth.\n4. Print the tree in the specified format.\n\nLet's write the Python script:\n\n```python\n# Read the number of posts\nn = int(input())\n\n# Initialize an empty list to store the posts\nposts = []\n\n# Read each post and store it\nfor i in range(n):\n    k_i = int(input())\n    M_i = input().strip()\n    posts.append((k_i, M_i))\n\n# Initialize a dictionary to store the posts in a tree-like structure\ntree = {}\n\n# Function to add a post to the tree\ndef add_post(k_i, M_i, depth=0):\n    if k_i not in tree:\n        tree[k_i] = []\n    tree[k_i].append((depth, M_i))\n\n# Add each post to the tree\nfor k_i, M_i in posts:\n    add_post(k_i, M_i, depth=k_i + 1)\n\n# Function to print the tree in the specified format\ndef print_tree(post_id, depth=0):\n    if post_id in tree:\n        for item in tree[post_id]:\n            print('.' * depth + item[1])\n            print_tree(item[0], depth + 1)\n\n# Print the tree starting from the opening post (post_id 0)\nprint_tree(0)\n```\n\nThis script reads the input, constructs the tree structure, and then prints the tree in the specified format. Let's test it with the provided sample inputs.\n\n### Sample Input 1\n```\n1\n0\nicpc\n```\n### Expected Output\n```\nicpc\n```\n\n### Sample Input 2\n```\n5\n0\nhoge\n1\nfuga\n1\npiyo\n2\nfoobar\n2\njagjag\n```\n### Expected Output\n```\nhoge\n.fuga\n..foobar\n..jagjag\n.piyo\n```\n\n### Sample Input 3\n```\n8\n0\njagjag\n1\nhogehoge\n1\nbuhihi\n2\nfugafuga\n4\nponyoponyo\n5\nevaeva\n4\nnowawa\n5\npokemon\n```\n### Expected Output\n```\njagjag\n.hogehoge\n..fugafuga\n...ponyoponyo\n....evaeva\n....pokemon\n...nowawa\n.buhihi\n```\n\n### Sample Input 4\n```\n6\n0\nnakachan\n1\nfan\n2\nyamemasu\n3\nnennryou2\n4\ndannyaku4\n5\nkouzai11\n```\n### Expected Output\n```\nnakachan\n.fan\n..yamemasu\n...nennryou2\n....dannyaku4\n.....kouzai11\n```\n\n### Sample Input 5\n```\n34\n0\nLoveLive\n1\nhonoka\n2\nborarara\n2\nsunohare\n2\nmogyu\n1\neri\n6\nkasikoi\n7\nkawaii\n8\neriichika\n1\nkotori\n10\nWR\n10\nhaetekurukotori\n10\nichigo\n1\numi\n14\nlove\n15\narrow\n16\nshoot\n1\nrin\n18\nnyanyanya\n1\nmaki\n20\n6th\n20\nstar\n22\nnishikino\n1\nnozomi\n24\nspiritual\n25\npower\n1\nhanayo\n27\ndarekatasukete\n28\nchottomattete\n1\nniko\n30\nnatsuiro\n30\nnikkonikkoni\n30\nsekaino\n33\nYAZAWA\n```\n### Expected Output\n```\nLoveLive\n.honoka\n..borarara\n..sunohare\n..mogyu\n.eri\n..kasikoi\n...kawaii\n....eriichika\n.kotori\n..WR\n..haetekurukotori\n..ichigo\n.umi\n..love\n...arrow\n....shoot\n.rin\n..nyanyanya\n.maki\n..6th\n..star\n...nishikino\n.nozomi\n..spiritual\n...power\n.hanayo\n..darekatasukete\n...chottomattete\n.niko\n..natsuiro\n..nikkonikkoni\n..sekaino\n...YAZAWA\n```\n\n### Sample Input 6\n```\n6\n0\n2ch\n1\n1ostu\n1\n2get\n1\n1otsu\n1\n1ostu\n3\npgr\n```\n### Expected Output\n```\n2ch\n.1ostu\n.2get\n..pgr\n.1otsu\n.1ostu\n```\n\nThis script should correctly process the input and output the tree in the specified format.",
