              "text": "Certainly! Let's break down the problem and write a Python script to handle the sales activities as described. The script will read the input, process the queries, and output the results accordingly.\n\nHere is the Python script:\n\n```python\ndef process_queries():\n    while True:\n        q, lim = map(int, input().split())\n        if q == 0 and lim == 0:\n            break\n        \n        # Initialize the array to store the individual numbers\n        individuals = []\n        \n        for _ in range(q):\n            query, x = map(int, input().split())\n            if query == 0:\n                # Incubate an individual and assign a number\n                individuals.append(x)\n            elif query == 1:\n                # Lead the individual indicated by the nth number of the array to the theory of the ring\n                if x <= len(individuals):\n                    del individuals[x-1]\n            elif query == 2:\n                # Output the number of the xth individual contained in the array at that time\n                if x <= len(individuals):\n                    print(individuals[x-1])\n            elif query == 3:\n                # Lead the individual with the number x to the theory of the ring\n                try:\n                    index = individuals.index(x)\n                    del individuals[index]\n                except ValueError:\n                    continue\n        \n        # Print \"end\" at the end of each case\n        print(\"end\")\n\nprocess_queries()\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n1. **Reading Input:**\n   - The script reads the number of queries `q` and the limit `lim`.\n   - It then processes each query one by one.\n   \n2. **Handling Queries:**\n   - **Query 0:** Incubate an individual and assign a number. The number is appended to the `individuals` list.\n   - **Query 1:** Remove the individual indicated by the nth number of the array.\n   - **Query 2:** Output the number of the xth individual in the array.\n   - **Query 3:** Remove the individual with the number x from the array.\n   \n3. **Output:**\n   - After processing all queries, the script prints \"end\" to indicate the end of the case.\n\nThis script will correctly handle the sales activities as described and output the results based on the input provided.",
